[[File:Map Macedonia province.png|thumb|Macedonia (in red) on a map of the provinces of the Roman Empire circa AD 120.]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|la|grc|Μακεδονία|t=Macedonia}}, from {{m|grc|μακεδονία|t=highland}}, from {{m|grc|μακεδνός|t=high, tall}}.

===Pronunciation===
